Package: remini
Version: __VERSION__
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Remini developers <upupwrite@outlook.com>
Depends: libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libgl1, libegl1
Homepage: https://github.com/upupwrite/Remini
Description: Lightweight real-time Markdown renderer
 Remini is a simple, lightweight real-time Markdown renderer built with Qt
 Widgets. It renders Markdown in real time and hides formatting symbols while
 editing.
